# Vercel Ignore File
# File dan folder yang TIDAK akan di-deploy ke Vercel

# Development files
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# IDE
.vscode
.idea
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Git
.git
.gitignore

# Documentation (optional - uncomment jika tidak ingin deploy docs)
# *.md
# DOCS_INDEX.md
# DEPLOYMENT.md
# CONTRIBUTING.md

# Scripts
move-to-root.ps1

# Backup files
*.bak
*.backup
